<section class="sec navy"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">The Delta method</div><h2>Discover. Develop. Validate. Brief. <em>Implement.</em></h2><p class="lead">A transparent path from a local challenge to solutions decision-makers can use.</p><div class="method"><div class="rv"><span class="k">01</span><h3>Discover</h3><span class="bn">অনুসন্ধান</span><p>We scout campuses, open calls and the Idea Portal for people already solving real problems.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">02</span><h3>Develop</h3><span class="bn">উন্নয়ন</span><p>Mentors, labs and sprints turn a raw idea into a working prototype with a clear owner.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">03</span><h3>Validate</h3><span class="bn">যাচাই</span><p>Field tests, peer review and data show whether it works, for whom and at what cost.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">04</span><h3>Brief</h3><span class="bn">ব্রিফ</span><p>We write policy-grade briefs and put the evidence in front of the people who decide.</p></div><div class="rv"><span class="k">05</span><h3>Implement</h3><span class="bn">বাস্তবায়ন</span><p>Partners pilot, adopt and scale. The innovator keeps the credit and a fair stake.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="portal"><div><div class="eyebrow">The Idea Portal</div><h2>Your idea deserves a clear record.</h2><p class="lead">Submit a proposal, get a timestamped record and follow its progress through review.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn pri" href="{{ route('ideas.create') }}">Submit an idea &rarr;</a><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ route('public-ideas.index') }}">Browse the Idea Bank</a></div></div><div class="rcpt"><div class="hd"><span>DELTA IDEA RECORD</span><span>VERIFIABLE</span></div><span class="l">ID</span><br><span class="v">A unique record for your idea</span><br><span class="l">NEXT STEP</span><br><span class="v">Reviewed by the Delta team</span></div></div></div></section>

